### Symphony: the way in under a whitelist refusal. Kept apart from upstream's connection-messages.ftl.

whitelist-discord-link = To get whitelisted, link your Discord account: press Link Discord below, or copy the link and open it in your browser.
whitelist-discord-linked = Your Discord account is linked, but it does not hold a whitelist role. Get the role in the Discord and reconnect.
whitelist-discord-guest = Guest accounts cannot be whitelisted. Sign in through the launcher and reconnect.
